{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e728874e-3f9f-5ef5-92b7-ce987fee3bef",
    "name": "Ask API 💬💬💬",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "- Endpoint: `GET /ask1/api.{json|xml|txt|csv|tsv}` - natural language website list lookups.\n- Example sample request: `https://api.builtwith.com/ask1/api.json?KEY=YOUR_KEY&QUERY=Magento%20websites%20in%20Spain`\n- `QUERY` accepts normal URL-encoded spaces or dash-separated words, for example `Magento-websites-in-Spain`.\n- Each lookup uses 1 API credit and normal requests always return a sample.\n- Use `COMMIT=true` to create and run a full Ask report, returning up to 1000 results ordered by sequence.\n- Pagination: use `NEXTOFFSET` with the previous response's `NextOffset`; `END` means no more pages.\n- Optional: `META=yes` includes metadata. Results use Lists API result attributes, but Ask does not return `LOS`.\n\nSample response:\n```json\n{\n  \"Explanation\": \"Matched websites using Magento with a Spain location signal.\",\n  \"NextOffset\": \"opaque-next-offset-or-END\",\n  \"Results\": [\n    {\n      \"D\": \"example-shop.es\",\n      \"FI\": 1725494400,\n      \"LI\": 1767657600,\n      \"Country\": \"ES\",\n      \"Q\": 565,\n      \"S\": 323\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nUpdated 2026-11-10 from https://api.builtwith.com/llms-full.txt. Set KEY locally. Requests are examples; sending data requests may consume credits. Optional query parameters are disabled until selected."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Sample Natural Language Search",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.builtwith.com/ask1/api.json?KEY={{KEY}}&QUERY=Magento%20websites%20in%20Spain",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "api",
            "builtwith",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "ask1",
            "api.json"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "KEY",
              "value": "{{KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "QUERY",
              "value": "Magento websites in Spain"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
